@ Gangster Outbreak: one shared stock for all Kanto and Sevii marts (vending machines), one list per gang
@ rank (= Gym Badges). Generated by tools/gang_mart.py - edit the lists there.

EventScript_GangMart::
	special GangItems_CountBadges
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, 0, EventScript_GangMart0
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, 1, EventScript_GangMart1
